REM MOVE and DELTREE regression on disposable drives A and B.
B:
MD FROM
MD TO
ECHO ONE>FROM\A.TXT
ECHO TWO>FROM\B.TXT
A:\MOVE FROM\A.TXT , FROM\B.TXT TO
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED source list
IF EXIST FROM\A.TXT ECHO FAILED source retained
IF NOT EXIST TO\B.TXT ECHO FAILED second file
A:\MOVE TO\A.TXT A:\CROSS.TXT
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED cross-drive move
IF EXIST TO\A.TXT ECHO FAILED cross-drive source retained
A:\FIND "ONE" A:\CROSS.TXT >NUL
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED cross-drive contents
ECHO ORIGINAL>OLD
ECHO NEW>NEW
ECHO N>NO.TXT
A:\MOVE /-Y NEW OLD <NO.TXT
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED declined overwrite status
IF NOT EXIST NEW ECHO FAILED declined overwrite lost source
A:\FIND "ORIGINAL" OLD >NUL
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED declined overwrite changed target
ECHO Y>YES.TXT
A:\MOVE /-Y NEW OLD <YES.TXT
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED confirmed overwrite
IF EXIST NEW ECHO FAILED confirmed overwrite kept source
ECHO NEW>NEW
A:\MOVE /Y NEW OLD
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED overwrite
A:\FIND "NEW" OLD >NUL
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED replacement contents
A:\MOVE OLD OLD
IF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED self move
A:\MOVE TO RENAMED
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED directory rename
MD RENAMED\CHILD
ECHO LOCK>RENAMED\CHILD\LOCK
A:\ATTRIB +R RENAMED\CHILD\LOCK
A:\DELTREE RENAMED <NO.TXT
IF NOT EXIST RENAMED\CHILD\LOCK ECHO FAILED refused delete
A:\DELTREE /Y RENAMED
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED recursive delete
IF EXIST RENAMED\NUL ECHO FAILED directory retained
MD MATCH1
ECHO FILE>MATCH2
A:\DELTREE /Y MATCH*
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED wildcard
IF EXIST MATCH1\NUL ECHO FAILED wildcard directory retained
IF EXIST MATCH2 ECHO FAILED wildcard file retained

ECHO SOURCE>EARLY
A:\MOVE EARLY MISSING FROM
IF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED missing comma
IF NOT EXIST EARLY ECHO FAILED invalid grammar changed source
A:\MOVE EARLY,MISSING FROM
IF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED partial move status
IF NOT EXIST FROM\EARLY ECHO FAILED partial move order
ECHO ONE>ITEM1
ECHO TWO>ITEM2
A:\MOVE /Y ITEM* PARENT\CHILD
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED nested destination
IF NOT EXIST PARENT\CHILD\ITEM2 ECHO FAILED nested target missing
A:\DELTREE /?
IF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED help status
A:\DELTREE /Y NOMATCH
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED no match
CD PARENT\CHILD
A:\DELTREE /Y .
IF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED dot accepted
IF NOT EXIST ITEM1 ECHO FAILED dot deleted contents
ECHO SIBLING>..\SIBLING
A:\DELTREE /Y ..
IF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO FAILED parent accepted
IF NOT EXIST ..\SIBLING ECHO FAILED parent deleted contents
CD \
IF NOT EXIST PARENT\NUL ECHO FAILED parent scope
ECHO KEEP>ASK
ECHO NY>NOFIRST
A:\DELTREE ASK <NOFIRST
IF NOT EXIST ASK ECHO FAILED first N
ECHO YN>YESFIRST
A:\DELTREE ASK <YESFIRST
IF EXIST ASK ECHO FAILED first Y
MD ASKDIR
ECHO KEEP>ASKDIR\KEEP
A:\DELTREE ASKDIR <NOFIRST
IF NOT EXIST ASKDIR\KEEP ECHO FAILED directory first N
A:\DELTREE ASKDIR <YESFIRST
IF EXIST ASKDIR\NUL ECHO FAILED directory first Y
